Patch 0003 (fid-num-transcendentals) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Route sqrt, ln, min and max through fid_num::f (sqrt, ln, total_min, total_max) via algebra/knp.rs, replace powi by explicit products, stop on a non-finite mu with NumericalError, validate input data (CSC format, no NaN) at solver setup, and convert upstream panics (panic!, unwrap, unreachable!) to error statuses.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

